%description:
TR 36.873 defines an outdoor-to-indoor loss for 3D-UMi (clause 7.2.3: PL = PLb + PLtw + PLin, PLtw
= 20, PLin = 0.5 d2D-in), which the model does not implement: only its 3D-UMa has one. A UE with
insideBuilding = true under TR 36.873 URBAN_MICROCELL got the path loss of an outdoor UE, without
a message. The first evaluation of such a link is an error that says that the loss is missing in
the model, not in the study.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.EpcSessionTestNetwork

*.ue[*].insideBuilding = true
*.radioMedium.channelModelType = "Tr36873ChannelModel"
*.eNB*.scenario = "URBAN_MICROCELL"
# a microcell base station: TR 36.873 gives 3D-UMi for hBS = 10 m
*.eNB.cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 10m

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
is inside a building (insideBuilding), and the building penetration loss of TR 36.873 for the scenario URBAN_MICROCELL is not implemented
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
